<title>PHILIPPINES: Pacifica surges 10.71 pct on buy-in talk.</title>
<headline>Pacifica surges 10.71 pct on buy-in talk.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Oil concern Pacifica Inc surged 10.71 percent to 7.75 centavos on Friday midsession due to the ongoing buy-in negotiation with a subsidiary of Indonesia's PT Citra, traders said.</p>
<p>Pacifica confirmed on Wednesday a long-standing market rumour that it was negotiating with a unit of PT Citra of Indonesia, Strategic Alliance Development Corp (Stradec), for a possible buy-in.</p>
<p>Stradec is involved in infrastructure development.</p>
<p>&quot;A merger with PT Citra will definitely boost its value,&quot; one trader said.</p>
<p>Pacifica was one the most actively traded stocks on Friday.</p>
<p>-- Manila Newsroom (63 2) 841-8938 Fax 817-6267</p>
</text>
